'''Frankenstrike''', formerly known as '''Benvicktor''',{{Refn|[[:File:Afraid (1790).png|Afraid (1790).png]]|group = credits}}<ref name="BAotD"/>{{Refn|[[:File:Benvictor.png]]|group = Bandai}}{{Refn|[[:File:Frankenstrike Alien Creation Card.png]]|group = Bandai|name= accard}} is the [[Omnitrix]]'s DNA sample of a [[Transylian]] from the planet [[Anur Transyl]] in the [[Anur System]].{{Refn|group = Bandai|name = card}}

==Appearance==
===Ben as Frankenstrike===
Frankenstrike has an appearance similar to the classic depiction by [[Wikipedia:Boris Karloff|Boris Karloff]] of [[Wikipedia:Frankenstein's Monster|Victor Frankenstein's monster]]. He closely resembles an approximately seven-foot-tall{{Refn|[[:File:Frankenstrike 7 foot.png]]|group = TNP}} muscular human male, with four fingers on each hand and black hair with sideburns. Most of his skin is a dull, greyish yellow; however, some areas on his body have a different skin tone, which are separated by scars and what resembles sutures, as if his body parts were sewn together. He wears metal gauntlets that end in fingerless gloves; metallic boots with grills on them; and dark, shiny pants with ribs that dip in a V-shape. He has many bolts that resemble flathead screws in places all over his upper body; and he has two large tower-shaped, conductor coil-like generators located on his upper back; though these are metallic-organic growths and not actually machines.{{Refn|[[:File:Frankenstrike's Generators.png]]|group = pop-up}} <ref name="BAotD" />

In the '''[[Ben 10 (2005 TV Series)|Original Series]]''', Frankenstrike had a long mullet hairstyle with bangs, and his sideburns stretched outwards into a single point on each side. His second tone of skin was lighter, and stretched from his forearms up to his upper arm and shoulder, on his left and right arms, respectively. He had 4 bolts on his back, 3 on his chest, and 2 on each of his trapezius muscles; all of which were dark grey with a flat, black tip and a green line across it. His gauntlets and conductors were brown; his pants were black, and the slits in his boots were green. He wore a belt with a white line running around it, and the [[Omnitrix (Original)|original Omnitrix]] symbol in the middle, like a belt clasp.

In the '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]''' [[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)/Theme Song|intro]], Frankenstrike looked mostly the same, with a few notable differences. His skin had a much more natural color, and did not differ in tone despite having the exact same scars. While his pants remained black, his gauntlets; conductors; belt; bolts; and boots were all completely recolored grey and silver. The slits of his boots were black. The [[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]] symbol was located on his chest, replacing the top bolt in the grouping of 3 on his chest.

In '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''', Frankenstrike's hair is cut much shorter, though his sideburns have increased in length in a mutton chops-style. His two-toned skin returns, the second tone now being a more withered dark grey. Patches of it are located on his entire left shoulder and left pectoral; his entire right forearm; the top of his right shoulder; one spot on the middle-right of his back; and nearly completely covering his neck and face, save for some of the right side of his face. Suturing connects all the patches, as well as a circular "cut" around his cranium. Frankenstrike's bolts are now much larger and stumpier; they are a copper color, with green lines stretching across and off the tips. There are now 3 bolts on his back; 6 for each side of his neck, shoulder, and elbow; and one on his belt, where the Omnitrix used to be. His conductors have moved up more from his back and cover his trapezius muscles. They are now a deep green, with white coils and light green bulbs at the tips. His belt and gauntlets are green, with small screws appearing along their white stripe and knuckles, respectively. His pants are very dark green and his boots are copper with light green slits. Frankenstrike's teeth are now yellowed and uneven, and bear out. The [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]] symbol is embedded in the flesh of his right pectoral, with several deep scars protruding from where it resides.

