{{Quote|-"The controls are locked. I can't shut down the Corrodium beam."<br>-"No problem. A little lightning should do the trick."|[[Max Tennyson (Classic)|Max]] and Frankenstrike.<ref name="BAotD" />}}
Thanks to his bio-metallic conductor coils on his body, Frankenstrike can produce and manipulate bio-electric discharges as powerful as bolts of lightning{{Refn|group = Bandai|name= accard}} and capable of punching holes in a spaceship.<ref name="TR">''[[The Return]]''</ref> This electricity can be used to enhance his blows to increase the damage output,<ref name="MM">''[[Max's Monster]]''</ref> electrocute opponents through physical contact, attach to metallic surfaces,<ref name="BAotD" /> power-up machinery or overload specific parts of the technology,<ref name="MM" /><ref>''[[Something Zombozo This Way Comes]]''</ref> create waves that travel along the flat surfaces,<ref name="ATTWN">''[[And Then There Were None]]''</ref> as well as focus it into concentrated beams of energy.<ref name="CIU">''[[Cough It Up]]''</ref>

Larger Transylians like Frankenstrike are shown to have immense level of physical strength, being powerful enough to punch through a brick wall,{{Refn|group = Bandai|name=accard}} sever a [[Techadon Robot]]'s arm,<ref name="TCoM">''[[The Color of Monkey]]''</ref> carry an [[Appoplexian (Classic)|Appoplexian]] over their shoulders,<ref name="IaMMMBW2">''[[It's a Mad, Mad, Mad Ben World: Part 2]]''</ref> tear apart steel, <ref name="BAotD" /> as well as lift a tank over their head.<ref name="VTS">''[[Viktor: The Spoils]]''</ref> Their strength also extends to their legs, allowing them to jump between the roofs of [[Undertown]] buildings.<ref name="TCoM" />

Larger Transylians like Frankenstrike possess immense durability, being able to withstand plasma beams of Galvanic Mechamorphs and [[Ectonurite (Classic)|Ectonurites]] at full power, <ref name="BAotD" /> walk straight through bullets and tank shells,<ref name="VTS" /> and survive being blasted afar by energy beams from [[Phil Billings (Classic)|Phil Billings]].<ref name="MM" /> They are also highly resistant to extremely high temperatures, as shown when [[Dr. Viktor]] was ensnared in of molten steel.<ref name="VTS" /> Transylians can regenerate parts and heal from even serious injuries that are almost fatal.{{Refn|[[:File:Frankenstrike Alien Creation Card.png]]|group = Bandai|name=accard}}

Frankenstrike is quite fast, as demonstrated when Lightning Volt was able to keep up with [[Rath (Classic)|Rath]].<ref name="IaMMMBW2" />

Frankenstrike can survive in the vacuum of space. <ref name="BAotD" /> Frankenstrike can also see in the dark.{{Refn|[[:File:All Anur System Aliens Can See in the Dark.png]]|group = DJW}}

Frankenstrike is resistant to strong winds, as shown when he held onto part of a space station when Viktor opened up a portal in space. <ref name="BAotD" />

Frankenstrike can emit magnetism from his hands or feet, allowing him to attach to metal structures.<ref name="BAotD" />

Transylians possess technokinesis and can merge with technology, being able to generate electricity through their coils to power machinery, as demonstrated when Viktor controlled some cables with his mind and plugged them into himself.<ref name="TR"/><ref name="BAotD" />

===Non-Canon Powers and Abilities===
====Protector of Earth====
Frankenstrike can teleport short distances and create portals, as demonstrated by other [[Transylian]]s.

==Weaknesses==
<gallery type="slideshow">
CIU (253).png|Constrained by Large Size
MaxMonster115.png|Energy Absorption Vulnerability
</gallery>
{{Quote|You... couldn't pick a bigger door?|Frankenstrike to [[Argit]] and [[Rook Blonko]].<ref name="CIU" />}}
Frankenstrike is unable to fit through small or tight spaces due to his large size and coils.<ref name="CIU" /><ref name="ATTWN" />

The two generators on a Frankenstrike's shoulders is the source of his electricity, which means opponents like [[Phil Billings (Classic)|Phil]] can absorb their electricity through them.<ref name="MM" />

Transylians cannot conduct or absorb electricity from external sources.{{Refn|[[:File:Transylians Cannot Absorb Electricity.png]]|group = DJW}} This was shown when [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] knocked [[Dr. Viktor]] into exposed circuitry; Frankenstrike blasted Dr. Viktor with electricity; <ref name="BAotD" /> and when [[Rook Blonko|Rook]] and [[Scout]] used tasers to electrocute Viktor.<ref name="RMP">''[[Rad Monster Party]]''</ref>

Frankenstrike can be controlled and hypnotized by [[Vladat]]s via their [[Corruptura]]s, as demonstrated by Viktor and many other Transylian residents of [[Anur Transyl]].<ref name="TVSB">''[[The Vampire Strikes Back]]''</ref>

Frankenstrike can be scared by [[Toepick]]'s [[Toepick's Species|species]].{{Refn|[[:File:Toepick Can Scare Anur System Aliens.png]]|group = DJW}}

==History==
===Ben 10===
*Frankenstrike first appeared in ''[[Be Afraid of the Dark]]'', where he was added to the active playlist after the [[Omnitrix (Original)|Omnitrix]] "sampled" [[Dr. Viktor]]'s DNA.{{Refn|group = note|name = donor}} Frankenstrike battled [[Zs'Skayr]] and the [[Mummy]] on the exterior of the space station and personally sent Dr. Viktor into an ill-created portal before it closed.

===Alien Force=== 
*Frankenstrike was locked by the Omnitrix's reconfiguration in ''[[Ben 10 Returns: Part 1]]''.

===Ultimate Alien===
*In ''[[Ben 10,000 Returns]]'', Frankenstrike was re-unlocked by [[Ben 10,000 (Ultimate Alien)|Ben 10,000]].

===Omniverse===
*In ''[[Max's Monster]]'', Frankenstrike fought and trapped [[Phil Billings (Classic)|Phil]] in the streets of [[Bellwood (Classic)|Bellwood]].
*In ''[[Something Zombozo This Way Comes]]'', Frankenstrike fought some [[Zombie Clowns]] and defeated the [[Circus Freaks (Classic)|Circus Freaks]].
*In ''[[Cough It Up]]'', Frankenstrike defeated [[Kraab (Classic)|Kraab]].
*In ''[[The Color of Monkey]]'', Frankenstrike chased [[Rojo]] and fought a [[Techadon Robot]].

===[[Original Future Timeline]] ===
*Prior to ''[[Ken 10]]'', Frankenstrike was among the intelligent aliens used by [[Ben 10,000 (Original)|Ben 10,000]] to create an [[Omnitrix (Ken's Replica)|Omnitrix]] for his [[Ken Tennyson (Original)|son]]'s 10th birthday.{{Refn|group = pop-up|name = ken10}}

===Benzarro's Timeline===
*In ''[[And Then There Were None]]'', [[Benzarro]] as Frankenstrike chased after [[Ben Tennyson (No Watch Timeline)|No Watch Ben]] before [[Spidermonkey (Classic)|Spidermonkey]] got the latter to safety.
*In ''[[And Then There Was Ben]]'', Benzarro as Frankenstrike battled [[Vomit Man]] and [[Gwen 10 (Gweniverse)|Gwen 10]] as [[Wildvine (Classic)|Wildvine]] until he was sent back to his own timeline by No Watch Ben as [[Clockwork]].

