====[[Galactic Champions]]====
Frankenstrike, referred to as '''Transylian''', is an alien found in the game. He is the final boss of the third tournament, the Transyl Tournament. Unlike other aliens in the game, he's not able to be bought in the shop, he's only unlockable in the Portuguese version of the game when inputting the code "Travessuras" (Tricks).

Transylian is a powerhouse, he has high Health, Strength and Defense, but low Agility. His abilities help him deal even more damage or make enemies less likely to survive attacks.

His offensive abilities are:
*Punch - Transylian punches his opponent with lightning effects. Weak attack, doesn't waste any energy.
*Electrical Fists - Stronger variation of Punch, clears the enemy's status effects and has a chance to apply poison effect to opponent. Spends 15 energy.
*Technokinesis - Transylian punches the ground, making electricity come from under his opponent. Has a chance to apply enemy with taunt effect. Spends 30 energy.
*???

His defensive abilities are:
*Recharge - Reduces damage taken this turn and recovers some energy.
*Fury - Reduces damage taken this turn and increase attack stat. Spends 14 energy.
*Purify - Reduces damage taken this turn, gets rid of status effects and heals himself. Spends 30 energy.
*???

