==Etymology==
His placeholder name, Benvicktor, is a combination of "[[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]]" and "[[Dr. Viktor|Vicktor]]".

The name Frankenstrike is a combo of the name of Frankenstein, referencing his resemblance to [[Wikipedia:Frankenstein's monster|Frankenstein's monster]], and the word "strike", as in a lightning strike, which alludes to his electrokinetic abilities.

==Trivia==
*Frankenstrike's placeholder name "Benvicktor" was assigned to him by the credits for ''[[Be Afraid of the Dark]]'' and toys during the '''[[Ben 10 (2005 TV Series)|Original Series]]'''. Therefore, Frankenstrike is one of the four aliens whose working name had Ben's name in it, the other three being [[Blitzwolfer]], [[Snare-Oh]], and [[Nanomech]].
**In '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''', the name "Benvicktor" was replaced with Frankenstrike. [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] probably came up with Frankenstrike's name when he was 11 years old.{{Refn|[[:File:Ben named Frankenstrike when he was 11.PNG]]|group = DJW}} 
*Similar to [[Arctiguana]], Snare-Oh, [[Upchuck|Murk Upchuck]], and [[Buzzshock (Classic)|Buzzshock]], Frankenstrike appeared in '''Omniverse''', but he did not appear in ''[[A New Dawn]]''.
*Frankenstrike is one of five aliens featured in '''Omniverse''' who generate green electricity; the others being [[Upgrade (Classic)|Upgrade]], Buzzshock, [[Brainstorm]], and Nanomech.
**Unlike the others, however, the color of Frankenstrike's bio-electricity discharge matches that of other Transylians.{{refn|[[:File:Transylians' Bio-Electricity Discharge.png]]|group = pop-up}} <ref name="BAotD" /> 
*In the '''Original Series''', Frankenstrike was considered to be Ben's second smartest alien.{{Refn|[[:File:The Return Pop-up (25).png]]|group = pop-up}} This was retconned in '''Omniverse''', as hyper-intelligence is not a common trait among Transylians. Therefore, Ben does not become any smarter as Frankenstrike.{{Refn|[[:File:Malware locked Feedback.png]]|group = MW}}{{Refn|[[:File:Transylians Enhanced Intelligence Retconned.png]]|group = DJW}}{{Refn|[[:File:Charlotte McDuffie's Opinion on Frankenstrike's Intelligence.png]]|group = CM}}
*Frankenstrike's '''Original Series''' design was made by [[Thomas N. Perkins IV]].{{Refn|[[:File:Tom Designed S3 & S4 Characters.png]]|group = TNP}}
**Frankenstrike's '''Omniverse''' design was made by [[Derrick J. Wyatt]].{{Refn|[[:File:Some of the Aliens Designed by Derrick in OV.png]]|group = DJW}}
*Frankenstrike's appearance is based off of [[Wikipedia:Mary Shelley|Mary Shelley's]] [[Wikipedia:Frankenstein's monster|Frankenstein's monster]].
*Thomas believes that Frankenstrike is capable of absorbing electricity.{{Refn|[[:File:Frankenstrike may be able to absorb electricity.PNG]]|group = TNP}}
*Thomas believes that the generators on Frankenstrike's back are the product of some sort of nanite symbiosis.{{Refn|[[:File:Thomas Perkins' Opinion on Frankenstrike's Generators.png]]|group = TNP}}
*Frankenstrike was considered to appear in the [[Ben 10 (2016 TV Series)|Reboot]] but did not make the cut as an electric alien for [[Ben Tennyson (Reboot)|Ben]] because [[Shock Rock]] was created for plot purposes.{{Refn|[[:File:Shock Rock's Purpose.png]]|group = DR}}
*Frankenstrike is [[David Kaye]]'s favorite Omnitrix alien.{{Refn|https://www.youtube.com/live/unaX1hKhOy4|group = DK}}

